":"KDTree"}]},"doc://SpatialTrees/documentation/SpatialTrees/Quadtree":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Quadtree","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Quadtree","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees\/Quadtree","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A quadtree: elements at points in a rectangle, which finds those in a box, within a radius","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of a point, or nearest a point, and takes insertions and removals as the points move.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Quadtree","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/spatialtrees\/quadtree","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SpatialTrees/documentation/SpatialTrees/KDTree/indices(in:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/spatialtrees\/kdtree\/indices(in:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees\/KDTree\/indices(in:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The indices of the points in "},{"code":"box","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", its faces included, ascending."}],"title":"indices(in:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"indices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BoundingBox","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12SpatialTrees11BoundingBoxV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Point","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SpatialTrees/documentation/SpatialTrees/Trees":{"url":"\/documentation\/spatialtrees\/trees","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees\/Trees","abstract":[],"title":"Trees","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://SpatialTrees/documentation/SpatialTrees":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees","title":"SpatialTrees","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Trees over points and boxes in space that find the points nearest a query or within a radius or a box, and the boxes that overlap.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/spatialtrees"},"doc://SpatialTrees/documentation/SpatialTrees/SpatialBoxItem":{"role":"symbol","title":"SpatialBoxItem","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpatialBoxItem"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees\/SpatialBoxItem","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpatialBoxItem"}],"url":"\/documentation\/spatialtrees\/spatialboxitem","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An item of an MX-CIF quadtree or octree: a box and the element stored over it."}]}}}